@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Contact Role API
	Testing Koroneiki Contact Role API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Default Team Role     |
	| Optional Account Role |
	| Optional Team Role    |

Scenario: Create and view account contact role
	Koroneiki account contact role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |

Scenario: Create and view team contact role
	Koroneiki team contact roles created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |

Scenario: Create and view multiple account contact roles
	Multiple account contact role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |

Scenario: Create and view multiple team contact roles
	Multiple team contact roles created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |

Scenario: Update and view account contact role
	Koroneiki account contact role updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: Update and view team contact role
	Koroneiki team contact roles updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role"

Scenario: Update no contact role type and view
	Koroneiki account contact role types should not be able to updated via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                     |
	| Type        | Team                                  |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                   |
	And I update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                             |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Team Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for teams |
	| Name        | Optional Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                                |

Scenario: Delete account contact role and view
	Koroneiki account contact role deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: Delete team contact role and view
	Koroneiki team contact roles deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for teams |
	| Name        | Default Team Role                  |
	| Type        | Team                               |
	And I delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Team Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Team Role"